        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_349_chiave",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, don't give me that look\u00a0\u00a0, Broca.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chiave"
    },
    {
        "text": "If things don't go our way, all we gotta do is split.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chiave"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_349_chiave",
        "name2": "char_346_aosta",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah... I don't think it's that simple, but he has a point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aosta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "char_346_aosta",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So how about it, Broca? Are you on board?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aosta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "char_346_aosta",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'll give it a try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
