    },
    {
        "text": "You're finally awake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are we...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The forest. Our team was attacked by a pack of beasts, and the two of us fell off the cliff. Remember now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, you're not very cute, are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I still gotta thank you. If it wasn't for you, I might've\u00a0\u00a0 died there on the spot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't mention it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Aghhhhhhhh! Fine, okay! I'm sorry I picked that bone with you yesterday. I shouldn't have said that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm a little testy\u00a0\u00a0, you see. I don't like it when I hear someone badmouthing Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you're new here. It's not your fault you don't know what we're like just yet. Yato really tore me a new one last night. Don't take it personally, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I was at fault myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, c'mon. I did you wrong, and I'll own up to that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, let's put it behind us. That fine with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, that's a weight off my shoulders. It's been bothering me all day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's everyone else?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No idea. With their skills, I'm sure they can hold their own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We should look for them, then... Ugh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold up, bro. You shouldn't move around yet, what with how hurt you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "'Bro?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, that's just what I call everyone. It's more intimate. You don't have a problem with that, do you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Call me whatever you want.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, that settles it. Let's rest up here for the time being. We'll get moving once you heal up a bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, don't worry. Yato's there with them. She's one of the most experienced operators we have. Nothing's gonna happen to them. Let's take care of ourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, you lie down here a bit more. I'll take a look around.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
