        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "crossfade": 3.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yo, bro. Broca. I'm back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I took a stroll around. This forest is huge. We gotta be a bit more careful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "My wound's starting to get better. Let's move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You sure you don't want to rest a little more?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right on, let's get moving, then. I have a decent idea of which way we came from.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_forest",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, bro, I've been wondering. What's with that saw on the back of your drill?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't see you using it much when you fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I use this when I do retrofitting work. It's for sawing wood, among other things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sawing wood? So you used to be a lumberjack or something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I wasn't. I just like crafting sometimes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, I didn't expect you to be the crafty kind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's nothing that amazing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, bro, I just noticed there's one more thing I'm wrong about you. When we left for this mission, I thought you were the type to keep to himself. I didn't know you could be so talkative.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should talk more. Try to express yourself if you don't want people to get the wrong idea. I mean, yesterday was the perfect example.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I actually mean it, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean you don't trust Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Man, that's what I was talking about. You just got here, makes sense that you'd be a little iffy on the place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really, though, hear me out on this one. You really shouldn't talk like that. The first thing you said was 'I don't trust Rhodes Island.' What kind of impression do you think that gives the rest of us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, stop right there, bro. I'm not trying to say you're hurting anyone's feelings or to tell you to shape up or anything. It's just, well, how should I say\u00a0\u00a0 this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "You see, I used to be a mercenary, and I've worked for organizations before, too. When I first got here, it was purely transactional. I was just here to make a living.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "They treat us well, and the food's not bad, but that's about it. If you'd asked me back then, I probably would've told you I don't believe in that good, charitable company bull crap.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, all the big companies are basically the same. You feel the same way too, no?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But anyway, I've been here for a while, and I can tell. Rhodes Island is different. This is something you need to learn yourself. Ain't nobody can teach you that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "And yes, I trust Amiya, I trust the Doctor, and I trust Dr. Kal'tsit. They all won\u00a0\u00a0 me over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't snap because the way you were talking bugged me. I snapped because what you said was wrong. You know what I mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not sure...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, it's all good. I'm not telling you to figure it all out right now. What I'm trying to say is Rhodes Island isn't quite like what you think it is. You should try to trust in us a little more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't remember helping out the village being part of our mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Oh, that? It's actually the Captain's call. If he thinks we can manage it, in most cases, we try to do something to help the locals out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why bring that up all of a sudden?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No reason...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on... Wait, bro.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before the duo realize what has happened, the beasts that attacked the squad have already surrounded them."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like we got \u00a0\u00a0company.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can still fight...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't. You haven't healed up yet. I'll create an opening for you. Run away when you get the chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't leave you behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, bro, you know why I apologized to you in the first place?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't apologize even if Yato lectured me the whole night, but you shielded me when we got ambushed. That's when I knew you were a good guy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone like you will come to like Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, I owe you this one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, bro, don't be so stubborn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax. This is nothing. I ain't gonna die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca"
    },
    {
        "text": "Broca simply stands there and lifts his weapon as though he didn't hear the operator's plea."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, you really ain't cute at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can let it slide though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, then. Stay close to me, bro. I got your back, and you got mine. We'll bust through these jackasses and make it out of here, together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$b_char_defboost",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$b_char_defboost",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.9,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Just before the two of them could attack, a yelp can be heard from amongst the beasts."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Is that...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$sys_friend_intro",
        "key": "$sys_friend_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you two okay?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, there you are! We're fine!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_356_broca",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Broca, you don't look so good. Hurry. Sit down and let me take a look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_356_broca",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's Yato and the rest of the gang over there, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep, we've been looking for you two ever since you fell down there. It's such a relief to find you alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "It looks like you're hanging in there okay. We can't let our guard down, though. Let's leave this place to the others and take Broca back first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? What was that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_room_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#3",
        "name2": "char_346_aosta",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So how was your first field op, Broca?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aosta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#3",
        "name2": "char_346_aosta",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It was fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#3",
        "name2": "char_346_aosta",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Really? Great. I was worried you'd end up starting a fight. I guess I shouldn't have worried.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aosta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_356_broca#3",
        "name2": "char_346_aosta",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, I think... I can give this a try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    }
]